及普通仆妇有接手动作；王夫人一路有回报，往大爷处一路明确交给候差者，未声称全宅同步知情。莺儿抢针线、淡青袖口、甜羹银匙、三张旧月诗合匣及末句无人再念均已落实；没有死后朗诵、临终作诗、托梦或作者挽诗，厨房、洗衣、饭食与轮守始终继续。未发现本次材料可支持的BLOCKING问题。文学建议为ADVISORY：第25行母女互认说话不妥，第51行莺儿自责催食，第73行母女再次解释并和解，第95行又解释帮忙与推责，几段都把人物的照护压力说得很透，母女与主仆的口气趋同，也削弱了沉默和误会留下的余味。可删短其中一轮解释，让换手、递碗、收布等动作承担部分和解；此为节奏与人物声音建议，不将章卡、P-Lock或口味升级为硬约束。\",\n              \"sample_checks\": [],\n              \"subject_id\": \"chapter-81\",\n              \"subject_sha256\": \"a92799e04f61fdd2e99eb6eba99b38a7fa87ef2f5d137fc4eb1fdc681bccda0d\",\n              \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n              \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"record\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/7370c1dfd70658726bb9de11ab79ee6b34ea072d5b120de8929c104f2ffeb4a0.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"7370c1dfd70658726bb9de11ab79ee6b34ea072d5b120de8929c104f2ffeb4a0\"\n              },\n              \"raw_output\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/4130f7c04545b656080e2468f2ba42e5f1d2eb6a7517393aa1a5c1cab1379bdb.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"4130f7c04545b656080e2468f2ba42e5f1d2eb6a7517393aa1a5c1cab1379bdb\"\n              },\n              \"packet\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/b6cc5c40fd9523872c99dd00ae6762488f50b6eb4653118a85f320e80b1985f2.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"b6cc5c40fd9523872c99dd00ae6762488f50b6eb4653118a85f320e80b1985f2\"\n              },\n              \"same_packet_context\": true,\n              \"reviewer\": {\n                \"context_isolation\": {\n                  \"asserted\": true,\n                  \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                },\n                \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-81-001-r2\",\n                \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                \"model\": {\n                  \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                  \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                },\n                \"session_id\": \"review