探春远适之后只经家书或传闻低频出现”不完全相合。建议由带信人可知范围转述送出过程，或由作者有理由地替换这一规划安排。此为规划卡写作边界的ADVISORY，不能升为A-W1 LOCKED硬门。entry_from所指83-S2实际存在且与包选版本哈希相同，没有绑定失败。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-83-3\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"e1bfb521cea8691c8b5ba507e024a293ba5870a8fb11a8e1cc7a92fb6617ed86\",\n                \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n                \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch83/b219396269ed1f5b1781e7d8e0fedc636c06f21e0fe1e76134c3eeec4948daa8.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"b219396269ed1f5b1781e7d8e0fedc636c06f21e0fe1e76134c3eeec4948daa8\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch83-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"03e33a42a355c763b00400852373429163fb2674d3cb91e451e588eacc6e3391\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch83.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"7d090b6d8776c311b61956d86d41e5f453e9b0b858e139e3fb7e31c5b8981ebf\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/780a837ce24304e38dcd83912480cfa2ed384c167773a601fa8df267793fcc0b.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"780a837ce24304e38dcd83912480cfa2ed384c167773a601fa8df267793fcc0b\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/3c23def8ebc0cfa85c81d8c46c8fc060e08a294753ae4f2b34431d84e991d484.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"3c23def8ebc0cfa85c81d8c46c8fc060e08a294753ae4f2b34431d84e991d484\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/4d24bbc303c08f48cea12fb82960b413d2