  \"package_version\": null,\n                    \"python\": \"CPython 3.12.13\",\n                    \"version\": 1\n                  }\n                },\n                \"raw_excerpt\": \"立租契人系瑞应寺下院当家宗玉，今有二拔子庙上铺面房屋一所，共计十六间，今租沙河德春店作理生意，连借缸三口。对众言定每年租价清钱五十千正，只许客辞主，不许主辞客。房屋损坏，房主修理。恐后无凭，立租帖存照。现收租价清钱三十千正。租价不许增长。\",\n                \"raw_text_sha256\": \"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4\",\n                \"expected_text_sha256\": \"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4\",\n                \"rebuild\": {\n                  \"status\": \"PASS\",\n                  \"scope\": \"EXTRACTION_CONTENT_REBUILD\",\n                  \"manifest_ref\": \"asset:sha256:e0953b78c0d81651b56b799c02495d66c4dc5429578cffc85569b259e53e86f4\",\n                  \"output_sha256\": \"44977b3557cf6ec3d400a1311f98bf03ac97b4331cd00f0293511a7c5380110d\",\n                  \"unit_count\": 1,\n                  \"registered_toolchain\": {\n                    \"extractor\": {\n                      \"code_sha256\": \"8460754d64e3c798cafc851762ea3008b9272cc1cb1210cd9c87b36304be6e17\",\n                      \"name\": \"rcwh-extraction\",\n                      \"package_version\": null,\n                      \"python\": \"CPython 3.12.13\",\n                      \"version\": 1\n                    },\n                    \"dependency_lock\": {\n                      \"path\": \"requirements/extraction.lock.json\",\n                      \"sha256\": \"ce2435f11023cf01ec352aa6c1318ca75bff211a1ac10613b2f94ce8a26ca436\"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  \"current_toolchain\": {\n                    \"extractor\": {\n                      \"name\": \"rcwh-extraction\",\n                      \"version\": 1,\n                      \"code_sha256\": \"fcc5bdbe17dcccd36b2bdebb51e5fea4a262da941a6cb4a4a9683c4c6a9f36f4\",\n                      \"python\": \"CPython 3.12.13\",\n                      \"package_ver