"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-016-r1\",\n              \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-016-r1:1\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-017-r2\",\n              \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-017-r2:1\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"sample_coverage\": [],\n          \"opinions\": [\n            {\n              \"record\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/897c625239a8330f15e799d14f6dba7f5a15398f787238b7a87f2339283915d8.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"897c625239a8330f15e799d14f6dba7f5a15398f787238b7a87f2339283915d8\"\n              },\n              \"raw_output\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/cf6b5a108ce05b747111e23c1909e54babc07c409bf6be96e3532d15ed5a6173.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"cf6b5a108ce05b747111e23c1909e54babc07c409bf6be96e3532d15ed5a6173\"\n              },\n              \"packet\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/1f808af3093dbbc56b3a9657b6fdc102a9c5ba7817dbc517ec0140d838c2ab87.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"1f808af3093dbbc56b3a9657b6fdc102a9c5ba7817dbc517ec0140d838c2ab87\"\n              },\n              \"same_packet_context\": true,\n              \"reviewer\": {\n                \"context_isolation\": {\n                  \"asserted\": true,\n                  \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                },\n                \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-016-r1\",\n                \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                \"model\": {\n                  \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                  \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                },\n                \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-016-r1:1\"\n              },\n              \"notes\": \"已完整通读候选101行、包、五场合同和政策；八份分派材料及packet均逐一核对SHA256相符，samples为空。正文第1行保留“花袭人有始有终”；第45—49行确有到蒋家、行礼与礼成后的共同生活，第51行才由袭人说“好歹留着麝月”，未用婚前许可或出门代替成礼。第19—33行钥匙和药盒交给麝月，公用针线匣留下，嫁后回访未恢复袭人的差事；第59—93行病讯、死讯、探看请求与受阻回话逐层进入人物所知，来人不知临终细节，未出现绝命信或受虐场景。保留两项建议级异议：(1) 第95行送来的汤碗放稳后，第97行忽然出现“她拿下来的空碗”并交人往厨房送，第99行宝玉才“喝了一点汤，将碗放下”；如果是另一只旧碗，应交代它从何处取下，否则读者易把同一碗理解为先空后饮，建议明确两只碗或调整次序。(2) 第23行“正因为服侍久，才不能把公私混在一处”及第61行“先把话送到该送的人耳朵里”将物权、传话原则直接说破；结合第55、91、97行反复分派差事，人物口吻有时接近统一的管理说明。建议让已有的剪子、卡锁和提盒动作承担部分说明。FAIL仅表示这些实际阅读异议，严重度为ADVISORY；未发现完整性失败或分派政策中LOCKED原字、先后要求的违反。分派范围无未读；未审阅未分派章节、其他读者意见或包外原作图像。\",\n              \"sample_checks\": [],\n              \"subject_id\": \"chapter-88\",\n              \"subject_sha256\": \"16a578156216378fcc0902e116b55784007a1301929f5ed53bd866665e054f2b\",\n              \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n              \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"record\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/9e33a8434295640c852ea93cd453b748ad4ff3c0c464e3b748c132bc9f3af45d.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"9e33a8434295640c852ea93cd453b748ad4ff3c0c464e3b748c132bc9f3af45d\"\n              },\n              \"raw_output\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/152192aba0c1acdde948be708db2a3de51e9a0ca6fab94393e6f028e8efd137c.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"152192aba0c1acdde948be708db2a3de51e9a0ca6fab94393e6f028e8efd137c\"\n              },\n              \"packet\": {\n                \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/1f808af3093dbbc56b3a9657b6fdc102a9c5ba7817dbc517ec0140d838c2ab87.json\",\n                \"sha256\": \"1f808af3093dbbc56b3a9657b6fdc102a9c5ba7817dbc517ec0140d838c2ab87\"\n              },\n              \"same_packet_context\": true,\n              \"reviewer\": {\n                \"context_isolation\": {\n                  \"asserted\": true,\n                  \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                },\n                \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-88-017-r2\",\n                \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                \"model\": {\n                  \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                  \"veri