事和搬运者各有经手劳动；第67行贾芸分不开手时请旧仆帮另一边，没有独力包办。第77—79行王夫人仍有小包现金可付眼前车脚，旧仆的旧欠不能从中擅挪，给饭不抹工资；第93—105行该仆仍因睡处争执、最终获暂铺却再问追欠去处，欠薪压力没有随迁居消失。没有探庵W2、权贵或大额资源救场，钱仍存在而流动受限的E1功能明确。贾芸第19行从外到门上等待引入，再往返找人问车问院，提供了候选内可见的在场路径；合同自身未将此偷升为已注册原子事件，保留UNKNOWN/PENDING合理。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-89-5\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"c2186b267d8a1a128b48016d916697e2b6183a99e98f476eb403256d796410f0\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch89/98b90821bf2f23f91bf2745747623aae61c781a30213dfe6089eee963a826d4a.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"98b90821bf2f23f91bf2745747623aae61c781a30213dfe6089eee963a826d4a\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch89-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"7398fd59bc43c949c4dca161d49c043b6f8b8726065daaaca1a8c1e0e6e1d824\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch89.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"f0dc4bb3de96a10d6b5090c169834a17e97916dd6ad95fc95abaa71787ce1033\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/d6e2e3d5f845aff557e47dc7be9b020f09c38258caa37596b3a703579857ec6a.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"d6e2e3d5f845aff557e47dc7be9b020f09c38258caa37596b3a703579857ec6a\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/7ba302c840c4bbb137bafd7d37bd4ed11a0cc00bc5e4e040dc1f02b7f23bf8c6.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"7ba302c840c4bbb137bafd7d37bd4ed11a0cc00bc5e4e040dc1f02b7f23bf8c6\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n  