“做生意”替代。上下文明确乾隆三十九年（1774年）、十六间铺面房租给沙河德春店、每年五十千及现收三十千，后接六月初六日与宗玉、见证人等署名；附近解释沙河、二拨子位于今昌平区。源记录明确把见证载体限定为北京市文物局页面录文，并把用途限定为北京地区存在租契及租价约定，不推到贾家具体住宅或租价，范围适当。本项无分派图像；PASS针对固定官方网页的录文和书目/限定用途，不等于目验清代契约原件或独立确认网页转录无误。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"source:src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"d7a4cc2e0eb39ac6643c2c7033f294e6ab75c97b55d82eb539f0fdaa02d8ea4b\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"findings\": [],\n            \"advisories\": [],\n            \"superseded_opinions\": [],\n            \"prior_context_opinions\": [],\n            \"pending\": [],\n            \"source_proof\": {\n              \"source_id\": \"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract\",\n              \"findings\": [],\n              \"excerpt_revision\": {\n                \"ref\": \"asset:sha256:e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c\",\n                \"sha256\": \"e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c\",\n                \"previous_source_sha256\": \"fb2845103abef44f85900f24c064d3139ae138b63837902f9f68727aaf817235\",\n                \"status\": \"PASS\"\n              },\n              \"asset\": {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset:sha256:15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc\",\n                \"path\": \"sources/primary/received/15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc/rental.html\",\n                \"sha256\": \"15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc\",\n                \"bytes\": 37389\n              },\n              \"locator\": {\n                \"schema_version\": 2,\n                \"kind\": \"HTML_TEXT_SPANS\",\n                \"extraction_ref\": \"asset:sha256:e0953b78c0d81651b56b799c02495d66c4dc5429578cffc85569b259e53e86f4\",\n                \"output_sha256\": \"44977b3557cf6ec3d400a1311f98bf03ac97b4331