r1:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整阅读90-S2.v2的600行。受赠病妇无实体ID、participants_status=PENDING、宝玉身体与宝钗角色入口/出口UNKNOWN均诚实保留，没有硬认95回旧夹袄同一性。正文第23—35行经小丫头转述病妇受冷，宝钗听完再问，夹衣由宝玉折交、宝钗包裹、小丫头送达回报；包衣布留病妇处也有询答，赠衣知识链与物件路径完整。第37—49行受冷来自衣少仍站穿堂，披风是宝钗午后原要用之物，实际披给宝玉后又在补衣完成时收回，补缺劳动有代价。第45行宝玉说“你说的我知道”后仍坚持病妇冷、不能取回衣；第99行又想托问病妇热饭，麝月指出自己劳动限制，未写成改过或慈善圣人，也未把宝钗写成吝啬。两次含讽有实物支撑，未用词牌诗作或功名长论替代。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-90-2\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"8af5c6c27fa27ebe5b3a2c27e91f23ed5d2b9a8781e7afb8bfa7358b33faf665\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"findings\": [],\n            \"advisories\": [],\n            \"superseded_opinions\": [],\n            \"prior_context_opinions\": [\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/2c56f1e060ccfa73251615b48bd6fb4995ff7c4ebba5479b13775045d90a99cf.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"2c56f1e060ccfa73251615b48bd6fb4995ff7c4ebba5479b13775045d90a99cf\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/78ccb89c20a4c9e6704f5f3cff3603d91650576b26eefd74a8d87468afde3f03.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"78ccb89c20a4c9e6704f5f3cff3603d91650576b26eefd74a8d87468afde3f03\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/083c0a0d76931394288f366d7aad2c7cd8293a62714374dcb3574160747fb655.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"083c0a0d76931394288f366d7aad2c7cd8293a62714374dcb3574160747fb655\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": false,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHA