              },\n                \"notes\": \"完整阅读91-S3.v2.json（817行）。正文第57行凤姐脚尖扫去薄雪，第61行由她隔纸拈起，平儿和麝月扶人；第63—65行书办仅写“玉样物一”，补问位置及触碰，经凤姐核明“拾起”而非“拿走”；第67行明确仍待接办，后由里头另一人先接记录再收干纸连物，回答收妥后才放行。登记者与最终收受者不是同一动作或同一已认定身份，收受者未具名，平儿也未听见姓名，符合R1/R2及F3。第69、103行传回的信息限已记、纸物收妥和拾得位置；无通灵玉鉴定、感应、归还宝玉或既定罪由。合同的OPEN与UNSPECIFIED_RECIPIENT边界保留。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-91-3\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"4f6f778960742fd473471e13828dddc2abfd739216e2c6bd732d99c65642b597\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/9bbd4cda35c6b228b961bf6943bdccd07df2aa013294506c02f2752b8241724e.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"9bbd4cda35c6b228b961bf6943bdccd07df2aa013294506c02f2752b8241724e\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/86720cb9893470b3e4fdbdec51e9dd69754fa24ec1b95ad64b9c96ee244bd2b3.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"86720cb9893470b3e4fdbdec51e9dd69754fa24ec1b95ad64b9c96ee244bd2b3\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/ba010c462c9c9e89d5a8a9872b44f6c400f8f1180b5c7fcc5c5b9db8a494a613.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"ba010c462c9c9e89d5a8a9872b44f6c400f8f1180b5c7fcc5c5b9db8a494a613\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": true,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"b5fbf3bd7891:CHAPTER-91-025-r2\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:b5fbf3bd7891:CHAPTER-91-025-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整读91-S3.v2.json的817行。对照正文第57至69行：凤姐先脚尖扫开薄雪，再借两人扶持隔纸拾起；书办另以“玉样物一”登记，并追问见物位置及谁曾碰过；凤姐核对“拾起”不等于“拿走”。随后书办催另一未具名人出来，先接记录并念名目，再收妥干纸及物、口头确认后才放行。发现、登记、交回是有先后的不同动作，书办没有被替作最终收受者，平儿、宝玉未领物。第103行宝玉所见小纸没有“玉样物一”，其知识来自平儿口述；从未把物鉴定为通灵玉、解释归原主或以传唤反证身份。R1/R2与F1至F3均获正文支持，OPEN边界保持。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-91-3\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"4f6f778960742fd473471e13828dddc2abfd739216e2c6bd732d99c65642b597\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"findings\": [],\n            \"advisories\": [],\n            \"superseded_opinions\": [],\n            \"prior_context_opinions\": [\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/1b1e28551c1a5cbe6316cdba2aadac2576002c8910b018cad7f82901970db905.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"1b1e28551c1a5cbe6316cdba2aadac2576002c8910b018cad7f82901970db905\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/8688b92268ca3b855cfaa2c54bfde7b0a79738a9cfee4938c3c5c9e981489425.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"8688b92268ca3b855cfaa2c54bfde7b0a79738a9cfee4938c3c5c9e981489425\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/8cee909eb61503e900aeb0839786c810947180ec0a651d857d2794798deb6626.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"8cee909eb61503e900aeb0839786c810947180ec0a651d857d2794798deb6626\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": false,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-91-025-r2\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-91-025-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整通读91-S3.v2全部817行。身份开放有充分文本落实：正文第57—63行凤姐扫雪、隔纸拾起，书办只记“玉样物一”，第65行核对“拾起”不等于“领走”，无神光、感应或与通灵玉合并。发现与登记也不是同一瞬间。但是R1/R2要求登记后接交回链、写清物件交接，对照第67—69行仍有实质缺口：凤姐把物推落干纸后松手，书办去催接办，而离开时仍明说“交回的事还待接着办”；最终由谁实际收妥、物是否已交入保管均未明，不能据此把OT91-02的RETURNED_TO_HANDLING_CHAIN视作已完成。合同还把UNSPECIFIED_RECIPIENT扩写为不得由书办本人收受；未指定本身只能支持未知，不能作为排除某个职业经手者的源证。该排除可声明为本研究版本自选安排，但不宜让它迫使正文一直停在待办。建议允许不具名者接收或只补现物交由守物方保管的动作，同时保留最终身份/去向开放。此为实现充分性与合同措辞的ADVISORY，不是A-W1-backed LOCKED违反或BLOCKING。无分派样本或未读范围。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-91-3\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"4f6f778960742fd473471e13828dddc2abfd739216e2c6bd732d99c65642b597\",\n                \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n                \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch91/0bf1f11f7a53f2112ac8eeaa21d166cf26737b7e29415de9f2624e808d22a6a1.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"0bf1f11f7a53f2112ac8eeaa21d166cf26737b7e29415de9f2624e808d22a6a1\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch91-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"8d8ec7489698b86a0b72a70a7bc4b079e538fb064e5e2902bd8573eba265e6ce\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch91.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"6e3df61f326892cf3b5cef20ad590a22055383f0559319ecbc4ad7289592bebf\"\n                