    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-92-029-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"已完整阅读并核对本项绑定材料，审查限contract-92-5及其所附候选上下文。R1/R2：第69行小红实际转告拆验要求后，茜雪剪开原先扎紧的线，并询问袜内布团是否也须取出；她问“知道他脚冷不冷”只得到“只问到能送”，没有越出知识来源。第71—73行将硌脚线结拆开重缝、旧棉拨匀，再为查验松叠包袜，旧情落在可用的厚袜上；第75行共同组装外衣、厚袜与另包炒米，毡是否可换仍明确未知。贾芸第77行只送至门外，小红问规则和守交接、茜雪托包并在第79行被要求退后，各有具体职责，无自由探监或翻案指挥。R3/F3的物流与知识分层完整：第77行尚待腾处查验，第79行衣缝、袜里、吃食逐项查，第81行“还须转进去”，第83行只确认已交往里转送并直说“穿没穿，眼下还不知道”；直到第85行才切入宝玉亲自在狱卒面前接到衣袜和吃食，收物小纸没有被拿来冒充实收证据。第87行宝玉仍“不知道是谁补的”，未凭包裹骤知茜雪来历或门外案情；第89行脚暖却鞋紧，第91行“暖的只有脚，肩背仍冷”，第93—97行湿巾与吃饭压力继续，未把厚袜写成全身恢复。第117—119行门外人物仍只知接物无退、未见宝玉穿，保持收受和来源知识的界限。F1/F2：无重金万能包、获释交换、旧怨清算、神迹或英雄营救；后文准返还也经官面另核，未由送袜导出。所需的物件、时间、因果和人物知识均有正文支持；补袜、换手托包、鞋紧等动作使较细的物流仍有生活阻力。无本项需保留的实质异议；合同局部入口/出口UNKNOWN及其他未分派主体不因本PASS获验证，无分派样本、图像或未读范围。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-92-5\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"ec069827f383cc7140ce9a4b7d28b5113feb19a645a1d64ee779b24be5e51137\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch92/2472cc0b1a0f0a48eef056e31266c12a52b89e43cf2a9289f1fe14426f3dbc37.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"2472cc0b1a0f0a48eef056e31266c12a52b89e43cf2a9289f1fe14426f3dbc37\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch92-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"bef7aee28509649d486478998f57f0dbc45f98432e8fad3ffb180b670dbfa726\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch92.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"8899d69328d92143e0ba1e2e3bdde86164d204363ba40f19ff1aae7c9735130b\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/49c4e715be138e9acc897645e46ae1001e4b4c492662cf3376c9c9d31355805a.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"49c4e715be138e9acc897645e46ae1001e4b4c492662cf3376c9c9d31355805a\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/c965780ebb3f0616392126fbc78489b124ddfc1deccaaab2acd04dc3fac003db.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"c965780ebb3f0616392126fbc78489b124ddfc1deccaaab2acd04dc3fac003db\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/8273e48ea5e768b3e2cdd3fac2d82e25b12ee6a338610384f3b864e4a097229f.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"8273e48ea5e768b3e2cdd3fac2d82e25b12ee6a338610384f3b864e4a097229f\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": false,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-92-028-r1\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-92-028-r1:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"已完整读取本任务所有分派材料并核对绑定哈希；samples为空，无图像任务，无分派未读范围。92-S5主要物流与知识边界成立：正文第69行先有小红实际转告准入/拆验规则，茜雪才据此剪去扎线、取出填布；第71—75行以拆粗针、拨匀旧棉、缝平、松叠、分包表现保暖职责，不使她处理案情。第77行贾芸送到门外即另去跑腿，第79行衣缝与袜里被实际查验，茜雪被要求退后，未出现当然探监权。第81行明确“还须转进去”，第83行只获已交转送人的回话且小红直说“穿没穿，眼下还不知道”；第85行再切到宝玉亲手接包、接吃食，故R3及F3所要求的发出、准入、转送、实收没有被合并。第87行宝玉不知道谁补的，第89—91行仅脚暖、肩背仍冷与仍候问，未从收物推成全身恢复、知全案或即获释放；F1/F2所禁的重金万能包、翻案指挥、神迹和劫狱均未出现。保留一条建议性异议：补缝的具体位置与指代不够一致。第69行最初写“袜口一处起了粗针”，随后“用指腹摸那道缝”；紧接第71行同一修补动作却定位为“粗线结正横在脚跟往上一点”，第87行接收时又称“脚跟处平平的一道补痕”，第91行由脚踝抵着。若意在追踪同一处粗针被拆平并在收物时得到回响，开头的“袜口”会使其物理位置漂移；若本来有两处缝，则应分清指代。建议统一初次定位为袜跟附近，或用一句交代由袜口另摸到袜跟。此为局部物件连续性与表述精度的ADVISORY异议，FAIL仅保留该异议；不是字节完整性问题，也没有据此主张A-W1支持的LOCKED硬约束违规。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-92-5\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"ec069827f383cc7140ce9a4b7d28b5113feb19a645a1d64ee779b24be5e51137\",\n                \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n                \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch92/2472cc0b1a0f0a48eef056e31266c12a52b89e43cf2a9289f1fe14426f3dbc37.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"2472cc0b1a0f0a48eef056e31266c12a52b89e43cf2a9289f1fe14426f3dbc37\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch92-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"bef7aee28509649d486478998f57f0dbc45f98432e8fad3ffb180b670dbfa726\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch92.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"8899d69328d92143e0ba1e2e3bdde86164d204363ba40f19ff1aae7c9735130b\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/7bc403b289db84c636ade6b931c5dae0a7f44dafc1e484b06e04432507f29b7d.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"7bc403b289db84c636ade6b931c5dae0a7f44dafc1e484b06e04432507f29b7d\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/43c5c90662f6ba67b1d99b700cf2d613581e89197190ed17c36508523b3427e3.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"43c5c90662f6ba67b1d99b700cf2d613581e89197190ed17c36508523b3427e3\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/6a594ba3d12ef01d5b77ed65896524c72c7a5cd3a17d49891fb93b8eacaa8892.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"6a594ba3d12ef01d5b77ed65896524c72c7a5cd3a17d49891fb93b8eacaa8892\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": false,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"b5fbf3bd7891:CHAPTER-92-028-r1\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:b5fbf3bd7891:CHAPTER-92-028-r1:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整阅读及字节匹配范围同本意见contract-92-4；本项逐一检查92-S5-R1/R2/R3与F1–F3。正文第69行小红先转告须拆验、不塞吃食，茜雪只问脚冷不冷，小红答仅问到能送；第71–73行茜雪拆去硌脚线结、拨匀旧棉重缝，包袜时因查验改作松叠，旧情由实物劳动呈现，无旧怨长篇或翻案指挥。第75行在小院把外衣、厚袜、炒米按已获规则分装，未获毡规则便不添；第77行贾芸送到门外离开，小红与茜雪仍抱物等待；第79行衣缝、袜内、吃食逐项验看，茜雪上前即被要求退后；第81行接物者明确“还须转进去”，接物小纸未充当宝玉收据；第83行只确认交给转送者，且小红纠正“穿没穿，眼下还不知道”。第85行另切监内，明写等候后狱卒叫名、当面交给宝玉并分递吃食，才构成实收。第87行宝玉“不知道是谁补的”，没有从收到包裹跳成知道准备者；第89–91行穿袜暖脚而鞋紧、肩背仍冷、半夜仍醒，未把局部御寒夸成身体恢复或获释。第119行家外仍只知无退、未见穿用，与监内叙述不同知情层次一致。全程没有当然探监权、重金万能包、神迹或营救队。备好、送出、准入、转送与实收的分段证据充足；茜雪未因备物自动知全案或小红全部门路。程序主要由人物被拦、候物与动手拆包承载，仍保留寒冷、手冻和袜子补痕的小说经验。合同尚未核定的局部状态未被拿来冒充历史事实。未发现本subject的完整性或A-W1支持的LOCKED硬约束违例；结论限当前候选对本合同的落实。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-92-5\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"ec069827f383cc7140ce9a4b7d28b5113feb19a645a1d64ee779b24be5e51137\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch92/2472cc0b1a0f0a48eef056e312