111—129行准返、领物、过门仍有区分，可再传问也保留，小红所得只是有限准返消息；全案未宣告结束，日用帮助不作决定原因。本回未见新增人物诗或预支门外经验，饭香与窄门落在家中等候者一侧，宝玉仍在原处。未读范围：93候选全文/93-S1领物放行/93-S2归家热粥及原二句实际位置，均未在本assignment分派，不越界补读；因此不能核证单次释放跨回是否无重复、原二句是否确已迁入指定位置、也不能核证缺角书箱与别回具体物没有误并。合同已明说原章卡为92末、93新位置为当前编辑安排；这里没有把新位置视作旧章卡支持或历史事实。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-92-6\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"910922fe2a673529cd3991c453adab1a21f895c477d9feeed88ee67ddba5a24c\",\n                \"verdict\": \"NOT_CHECKED\",\n                \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch92/bbb5609a22050171ce8813d99a9cf920ef51632fe284332bfc249ebe3df50770.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"bbb5609a22050171ce8813d99a9cf920ef51632fe284332bfc249ebe3df50770\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch92-agent-research-v6.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"8067b7effbdb010346c43a0cd6084e9d8cc0797212883b8d11428181194908cb\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch92.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"8899d69328d92143e0ba1e2e3bdde86164d204363ba40f19ff1aae7c9735130b\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ],\n            \"pending\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"binding\": {\n              \"path\": \"data/scenes/ch92_delivery_gate.yaml\",\n              \"sha256\": \"b207b3e25f59fef3711da9b6444e9b522d4840e6ffbab4648207bde73772afa9\"\n            },\n            \"context\": [\n              {\n                \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch92/bbb5609a22050171ce8813d99a9cf920ef51632fe284332bfc249ebe3df50770.txt\",\n                \"sha256\": \"bbb5609a22050171ce8813d99a9cf920ef51632fe284332bfc249ebe3df50770\"\n              },\n      