7c03ec757b6da7c\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/08b3f2eda2c903a21941b3fecf3ce0d6f795834ea08084d112518cfae3cb52f8.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"08b3f2eda2c903a21941b3fecf3ce0d6f795834ea08084d112518cfae3cb52f8\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/3e76d52825e07cdb7fff7ec1e82eda9e3129f32b94ba3b25a7213122acc35262.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"3e76d52825e07cdb7fff7ec1e82eda9e3129f32b94ba3b25a7213122acc35262\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/ae10921474ad21049d763da314a95db0b8afc56065d6a5b87a6f59cfffa0f1b6.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"ae10921474ad21049d763da314a95db0b8afc56065d6a5b87a6f59cfffa0f1b6\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": true,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"7efcee27264a:CHAPTER-94-039-r2\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared); fresh native reader\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:7efcee27264a:CHAPTER-94-039-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"已逐块全文读完本次read_in_full五文件至EOF（合计120895字节），并核对各文件摘要及packet绑定摘要一致；packet仅核摘要，未读其其他subjects，未读取未分派底层史料，故不据此声称史料/底层语义已核证。94-S5：正文以“巧姐要原先旧府那只小包……婆子说不清搬出后在哪一堆……拿眼前这块干布现包”保留旧包来源的缺桥，并明确当下取衣、卷褥、分干粮及经手。小钱加捡柴抵脚钱、婆子送到车边、平儿交孩子给刘氏、刘氏随车出城抵村并收衣褥，物流连续；未把平儿送到乡居，也未补造既往S02→S06搬运。孩子反复只问住几日与哪顿回来，未获成人危险全局。车脚回话有实际传递，救助规模与风险边界符合所派合同；不把合同UNKNOWN或章级接口当独立史料核定。\",\n                \"sampl