ENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:CHAPTER-97-045-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整读取97-S1.v2，文件SHA256符合分派。R1双箸、若兰旧衣、麒麟收箱见正文3—7、21—25、83、95行，R2自理三片瓦/工钱/房钱及咸淡口角见5、41—43、75—83行，R3饭—衣—信拆段见3—7、21—25、39—43、81行。F1未锁若兰死因、军务或终局，95行门声只落在木杖；F2未以看破替代经济，也未补麒麟取得的历史路径。合同将局部住址、衣物与麒麟保管链保留UNKNOWN/PENDING，与authoring义务区分合理。但就本候选的衣物动作回放保留异议：25行明确搭椅背并移椅，75行却称“刚放在床上”，没有交接动作；建议补清该次挪衣，免得早先避瓦尘的安排被无说明撤回。该瑕疵不涉及R34取得链的硬化，依本轮标准只作ADVISORY负面，不作BLOCKING。无分派样本。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-97-1\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"6bea94201ce17cf050e93bfd105d8f79b25b518bc6e333010002d82d108238ec\",\n                \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n                \"severity\": \"ADVISORY\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch97/26ddbcee34a91b22a9ad6288c9ec162b526b20de1286352677699bead3d9b3c3.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"26ddbcee34a91b22a9ad6288c9ec162b526b20de1286352677699bead3d9b3c3\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch97-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"c7c047c2d707e1686bc07395f5ef2ea2023d5367ff07a24e060ddd2d6d75c8a8\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch97.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"d3fa729bf41a9938e8a25a441c840e04285f4ee714631983bfebc2ece32053a7\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/efe30207e8d7402267e1730ed5d9e6bea7cb689c4ecd9b02f08d5f608