仍闻盏（99—101行）、继续裁黄纸（103—107行）；R3宝玉只在惜春庵现场出入，湘云收的是先前寄出的家常信（39行），其存在不等于即时全线传话。F1、F2未出现三人同悟、总断命运、同地会合、若兰或瓜州终局。次日妙玉之后回叙惜春裁纸以103行“是在宝玉走后”定位，不必强推三线同一时刻；日期未登记不据此补成注册快照。chapter与S1/S3所列局部衣物及视角异议仍保留，本项PASS不替它们消除。无分派样本。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-97-4\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"23d94a1561658749e7125f98d77593b6c994dcf8fea2d8d326232b052a3fb673\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch97/26ddbcee34a91b22a9ad6288c9ec162b526b20de1286352677699bead3d9b3c3.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"26ddbcee34a91b22a9ad6288c9ec162b526b20de1286352677699bead3d9b3c3\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch97-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"c7c047c2d707e1686bc07395f5ef2ea2023d5367ff07a24e060ddd2d6d75c8a8\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch97.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"d3fa729bf41a9938e8a25a441c840e04285f4ee714631983bfebc2ece32053a7\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/efe30207e8d7402267e1730ed5d9e6bea7cb689c4ecd9b02f08d5f6086b71bd6.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"efe30207e8d7402267e1730ed5d9e6bea7cb689c4ecd9b02f08d5f6086b71bd6\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/5da413b6080acbfac605f6fd37be757da671e59726a7880ae85975ce6ca4c9e5.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"5da413b6080acbfac605f6fd37be757da671e59726a7880ae85975ce6ca4c9e5\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \