名或治疗有效性；贾兰的误判被托不稳水碗的现场纠正，未变成旁白全知诊断。照料者煮粥、挪椅、挡风、递水均是现实劳动，满足R3，没有神示报应、病榻自论一生或提前榜评。日常段落重复的文学意见已归chapter-100作ADVISORY，不当作本合同硬性失败。合同保留的局部病程/事件UNKNOWN没有被本PASS取消。完整材料无未读项，分派样本为零。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [],\n                \"subject_id\": \"contract-100-3\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"df015a71cb1722ee8d5cc818eabd9f73a6e350390fce72398a2c4411503c700d\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n                \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n                \"applicability\": \"INPUT_CONTEXT_CHANGED\",\n                \"previous_context\": [\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"artifacts/candidates/ch100/25c484ca93a7fd7f7e4e963fe9f5fc334726bc1e0db1bfa32a2b73c32d6da383.txt\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"25c484ca93a7fd7f7e4e963fe9f5fc334726bc1e0db1bfa32a2b73c32d6da383\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/writing/packages/ch100-agent-research-v4.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"00fad706db5d71491179ae404ab5c0c3268dee1ca29a84df2224415fa21557c7\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"path\": \"data/promotion/policies/agent/ch100.v1.json\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"a67096b4662e824952333594b540c445fdf53f848de428d76169cb732b369694\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/23ec13d2094803c894b939f8f032b9276e8c96cd8c1bc5e431d34d1cd867eee0.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"23ec13d2094803c894b939f8f032b9276e8c96cd8c1bc5e431d34d1cd867eee0\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/efa261f3f53d31d11be9e7c21e500da1f5b402d5350f2f02e41737c7d55696a8.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"efa261f3f53d31d11be9e7c21e500da1f5b402d5350f2f02e41737c7d55696a8\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packe