: \"review:14b2b99a3a10:SOURCE-shared-059-r2:1\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ],\n            \"opinions\": [\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/20289655ffeaf2a63e1793e331d55aee142d08dcd62bf8b7687966ec19781bce.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"20289655ffeaf2a63e1793e331d55aee142d08dcd62bf8b7687966ec19781bce\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/44386f534cffe8835744a1ef1f52185c139ce9320da0f14afca39c35301e0eeb.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"44386f534cffe8835744a1ef1f52185c139ce9320da0f14afca39c35301e0eeb\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/de89c33266e7f5e425779596fbe12ede6d2862a5d1653eb2a1d2c35fe51b01c2.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"de89c33266e7f5e425779596fbe12ede6d2862a5d1653eb2a1d2c35fe51b01c2\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": true,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:SOURCE-shared-058-r1\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:SOURCE-shared-058-r1:2\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整读过本条记录和绑定 evidence，目读 PDF 第253页（书内页242）图。正文为林之孝家的介绍妙玉；相关话是其间标明庚眉的红色批语，前接“引十二钗总未的确，皆系漫拟也”，后署“壬午季春。畸笏。”。所摘“至末回警幻情榜，方知正副、再副及三四副芳讳。”逐字及标点与固定载体相符，双 span 只省去换行。庚辰本见证归属及批语层次由汇校本庚眉标记支持；不得把上文己夹对册籍人物的推测混同为此条确定名单，也不能由此确立小说内总榜的正式名称。此记录的 notes 正确保留该边界。另核固定 PDF 前置整理说明：书名《红楼梦脂评汇校本》，曹雪芹著、脂砚斋评、吴铭恩汇校，电子最终版3.1416，署2018.6.30；庚、眉、夹的略记解释支持本条载体/见证区分。现代汇校页不是庚辰手稿影印，本次 PASS 仅针对固定载体所呈现的转录和见证标签，不构成原稿鉴定。全部本任务字节绑定、evidence 与 source 绑定、原载体页图重建及 excerpt span 重算只读核对通过；以上目读判断独立于哈希结果。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [\n                  {\n                    \"notes\": \"已用图像工具目读 febc49… 页图。PDF253=印刷242；下部红色庚眉批语跨两行，清楚可读“至末回警幻情榜，方知正副、再副及三四副芳讳。”，后见壬午季春、畸笏。与 excerpt、spans、见证标记相符。\",\n                    \"sample_id\": \"src:gengchen:ch18:qingbang-layers:image:1\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"febc49afebf7ec894be1156bce5929f13e4789215521110f4744f3799cca4d0b\",\n                    \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n                  }\n                ],\n                \"subject_id\": \"source:src:gengchen:ch18:qingbang-layers\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"2c0f651dde538b6bbbee0e3f76d42f04e430771acd0285933f3609b645252ab9\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"record\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/records/d02175a3bb3d09412a54ee5c61346f307686577aa70c6686490ddbb9594ffe29.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"d02175a3bb3d09412a54ee5c61346f307686577aa70c6686490ddbb9594ffe29\"\n                },\n                \"raw_output\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_panel/raw/92b2f84f52fb66c993cd3690ca5b042b757a1b624aedbd45125dca84d05729bb.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"92b2f84f52fb66c993cd3690ca5b042b757a1b624aedbd45125dca84d05729bb\"\n                },\n                \"packet\": {\n                  \"path\": \"data/agent_release/review-packets/de89c33266e7f5e425779596fbe12ede6d2862a5d1653eb2a1d2c35fe51b01c2.json\",\n                  \"sha256\": \"de89c33266e7f5e425779596fbe12ede6d2862a5d1653eb2a1d2c35fe51b01c2\"\n                },\n                \"same_packet_context\": true,\n                \"reviewer\": {\n                  \"context_isolation\": {\n                    \"asserted\": true,\n                    \"verification\": \"NOT_PROVEN\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": \"14b2b99a3a10:SOURCE-shared-059-r2\",\n                  \"kind\": \"MODEL_SUBAGENT\",\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"label\": \"current agent environment (declared)\",\n                    \"verification\": \"DECLARED_NOT_VERIFIED\"\n                  },\n                  \"session_id\": \"review:14b2b99a3a10:SOURCE-shared-059-r2:1\"\n                },\n                \"notes\": \"完整通读本项 source record 与 evidence，并目读所派图像。固定载体为《红楼梦脂评汇校本》（书名页署曹雪芹著、脂砚斋评、吴铭恩汇校），目录所绑PDF路径及摘要相符；它是现代整理容器。PDF第253页、印刷第242页下部红色“庚眉”批语中，可读“至末回警幻情榜，方知正副、再副及三四副芳讳。”及“壬午季春。畸笏。”；前接对副册名单“皆系漫拟也”的纠正，区别于绿色己夹和黑色小说正文。记录引文、庚辰眉批归属与日期署名均与载体一致；两段跨度精确重组22字引文。支持批者所述末回情榜层级，不另行认定“警幻情榜”为小说内正式总榜名，也不据此确定各榜人物。\",\n                \"sample_checks\": [\n                  {\n                    \"notes\": \"已用图像工具目读 febc49… 图：页眉“红楼梦脂评汇校本”，页脚242；下部红色庚眉完整包含本项引文，末署壬午季春、畸笏。引文及标点与记录一致，跨PDF行断处仅省略换行；正副、再副及三四副未与前面的己夹拟名单混同。PDF定位253与印刷242对应。\",\n                    \"sample_id\": \"src:gengchen:ch18:qingbang-layers:image:1\",\n                    \"sha256\": \"febc49afebf7ec894be1156bce5929f13e4789215521110f4744f3799cca4d0b\",\n                    \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n                  }\n                ],\n                \"subject_id\": \"source:src:gengchen:ch18:qingbang-layers\",\n                \"subject_sha256\": \"2c0f651dde538b6bbbee0e3f76d42f04e430771acd0285933f3609b645252ab9\",\n                \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"findings\": [],\n            \"advisories\": [],\n            \"superseded_opinions\": [],\n            \"prior_context_opinions\": [],\n            \"pending\": [],\n            \"source_proof\": {\n              \"source_id\": \"src:gengchen:ch18:qingbang-layers\",\n              \"findings\": [],\n              \"asset\": {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\n                \"path\": \"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf\",\n                \"sha256\": \"374